### Register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "username": "test.user",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "demo.user",
  "password": "password123"
}
